# GENERATED, NEVER COMMITTED — mcp.json is written at runtime by
# marketing_app/mcp/self_register.py and carries TWO credentials: the
# workspace API key (X-Api-Key, for our own /mcp endpoint) and the Meta
# access token (Authorization: Bearer, for mcp.facebook.com/ads).
#
# This repo is PUBLIC. Gitleaks in .github/workflows/security-scan.yml scans
# the whole git HISTORY, not just the tip — a token committed once and
# removed in the next commit is still a leaked token. Hence: ignored before
# the very first `git add`, not after someone notices.
mcp.json

# And the template's companion, which this app deliberately does NOT use —
# see marketing_app/mcp/self_register.py for why a second writer would
# silently erase the first one's work.
mcp.template.json
